      "audio_file": "voice_03.mp3",
      "request_id": "1dad5b79b639856b1e7e95578237e8995a9d2b2862222a7d7856a745069c3f39",
      "projection_target": "segments[3]",
      "request_text": "二月达拉斯，面对弗里茨，他在决胜盘救回三个冠军点，最后逆转夺冠。",
      "matches_actual_projection_or_native_outro": true,
      "actual_audio_sha256": "c3bf0fb79043446d76894f4ba4310b116c3fd6fbefb2c8ad50689f6bd3858bc3",
      "actual_word_sha256": "af52fd9bf047f8ab0c68897a7d7d3313e00e07a8c6ebd7b664126051efb9a0b0"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_05.words.json",
      "audio_file": "voice_05.mp3",
      "request_id": "5d28abe81edfb1f825351f28225e40992ac3b32da93482d1029ebf88bd55f39e",
      "projection_target": "segments[5]",
      "request_text": "四月慕尼黑，两盘击败科博利，赛季第二冠到手。这一回，他在红土上举起奖杯。",
      "matches_actual_projection_or_native_outro": true,
      "actual_audio_sha256": "ca1410edf528464e32a9c7c75e1bea647a5f1a1e2b450efc23cd0372c9c954ed",
      "actual_word_sha256": "6a479a3dfb38bca85668d033151072bc23595eb188f18199bd2d28cf1addd66a"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_07.words.json",
      "audio_file": "voice_07.mp3",
      "request_id": "6f1396e11152c839721e6caf3e42bc062030a7c15beed8199b90c7de0dd56791",
      "projection_target": "segments[7]",
      "request_text": "可到了法网，他却在第二轮三盘输给科利尼翁。红土冠军，没有变成大满贯突破。",
      "matches_actual_projection_or_native_outro": true,
      "actual_audio_sha256": "822a6ca1dc6d59e1a7a4f9785b5df8ca7826112cb82d34d6e5bd7714bf8d29a8",
      "actual_word_sha256": "0bcb2961931e7cd792348f24092946078fb62692e4da0c44e273ceffe6e76c77"
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_08.words.json",
      "audio_file": "voice_08.mp3",
      "request_id": "bbb9abe520901d57acab8a10f0c7ca0673a2a48d330b3e73ec70a05c545d835f",
      "projection_target": "segments[8]",
      "request_text": "转上草地，斯图加特决赛又遇弗里茨。他三盘赢球，拿到生涯第一座草地冠军。",
      "matches_actual_projection_or_native_outro": true,
      "actual_audio_sha256": "c67c1a6dcddf7660ad48c890cf09fbc54229264b93055b445cf47a155c58f313",
